                "observation-uuid": "a4f33a26-00af-581a-b29c-10f12ba49025"
              }
            ],
            "remarks": "Give every element its own well-formed identifier, the one dependency relationships refer to. CycloneDX: set a bom-ref on every component, one that differs from the component's name.",
            "target": {
              "status": {
                "state": "not-satisfied"
              },
              "target-id": "sbom-cra-element-id",
              "type": "objective-id"
            },
            "title": "SBOM-CRA-ELEMENT-ID",
            "uuid": "116d79ed-e6e8-59b1-863c-7dbbf1615c53"
          },
          {
            "description": "\\[CRA Art. 13(7) / Annex I Part II (1)\\] SBOM is 269 days old; keep the documented component inventory current when components change",
            "links": [
              {
                "href": "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/2847/oj/eng",
                "rel": "help"
              }
            ],
            "props": [
              {
                "name": "finding-id",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "sbomtools:v1:78fe654fd47ccc0f"
              },
              {
                "name": "finding-key",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "cra-phase1|SBOM-CRA-SBOM-FRESHNESS|document"
              }
            ],
            "related-observations": [
              {
                "observation-uuid": "922b609d-9c78-52fe-ace0-18e64e42dffe"
              }
            ],
            "remarks": "Regenerate the SBOM when components are added, removed, or updated. CRA Art. 13(7) requires manufacturers to systematically document relevant cybersecurity aspects, and the Annex I Part II (1) SBOM must reflect the product's current components. A creation timestamp later than the evaluation date is reported like a missing one: correct the generator's clock or time zone.",
            "target": {
              "status": {
                "state": "not-satisfied"
              },
              "target-id": "sbom-cra-sbom-freshness",
              "type": "objective-id"
            },
            "title": "SBOM-CRA-SBOM-FRESHNESS",
            "uuid": "6cad7722-216d-549f-ae1f-fa723e8ae469"
          },
          {
            "description": "\\[CRA Annex I Part II (1)\\] No vulnerability data or vulnerability assertion found; include vulnerability information or a statement of no known vulnerabilities",
            "links": [
              {
                "href": "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/2847/oj/eng",
                "rel": "help"
              }
            ],
            "props": [
              {
                "name": "finding-id",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "sbomtools:v1:e48721d2aa6b495f"
              },
              {
                "name": "finding-key",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "cra-phase1|SBOM-CRA-VULN-STATEMENT|document"
              }
            ],
            "related-observations": [
              {
                "observation-uuid": "3a36c3d3-8540-55b4-b656-b8e8d95d23b3"
              }
            ],
            "remarks": "Include the product's known vulnerabilities in the SBOM, or reference the vulnerability disclosure report (VDR) or VEX that states them (Annex I Part II (1)). CycloneDX: list them in vulnerabilities\\[\\] with affects\\[\\].ref pointing at the affected components, or reference the published VDR or VEX from an externalReferences\\[\\] entry of type vulnerability-assertion or exploitability-statement.",
            "target": {
              "status": {
                "state": "not-satisfied"
              },
              "target-id": "sbom-cra-vuln-statement",
              "type": "objective-id"
            },
            "title": "SBOM-CRA-VULN-STATEMENT",
            "uuid": "d277eba0-792e-51b2-ac62-56e1002bd1d1"
          },
          {
            "description": "\\[CRA Annex I Part I (2)(f)\\] SBOM carries no integrity protection: sign the document, or reference from the product an attestation or certification that carries its hash (a serial number identifies the document but does not protect it)",
            "links": [
              {
                "href": "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/2847/oj/eng",
                "rel": "help"
              }
            ],
            "props": [
              {
                "name": "finding-id",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "sbomtools:v1:79540743f5ac8100"
              },
              {
                "name": "finding-key",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "cra-phase1|SBOM-CRA-DOC-INTEGRITY|document"
              }
            ],
            "related-observations": [
              {
                "observation-uuid": "dd369865-c640-551b-abda-e43fda1d34a3"
              }
            ],
            "remarks": "Protect the SBOM's integrity (Annex I Part I (2)(f)): sign the document, or reference from the product component an attestation or certification that carries the hash of the referenced document. A serial number identifies the document but does not protect its integrity. CycloneDX: sign the BOM (a JSF signature object at the document root in JSON, an enveloped XML-DSig \\<Signature\\> element on \\<bom\\> in XML), or add hashes\\[\\] to a metadata.component.externalReferences\\[\\] entry of type attestation or certification-report.",
            "target": {
              "status": {
                "state": "not-satisfied"
              },
              "target-id": "sbom-cra-doc-integrity",
              "type": "objective-id"
            },
            "title": "SBOM-CRA-DOC-INTEGRITY",
            "uuid": "fef3a7b9-a940-5f40-9136-e9115cfb366e"
          }
        ],
